cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Gate That Refused Its Authors: Construct-Validity Enforcement at the Baseline of LLM Stress-Retention Evaluation"
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Flores
    given-names: E. A.
    affiliation: "Apiana AI, Inc."
abstract: "An instrument paper describing a fail-closed validity gate that enforces construct validity at the baseline of a stress-retention evaluation, with a worked case in which the gate refused the authors' own candidate baseline. Scoped to one synthetic task family and one model (Qwen2.5-3B, FP16); pre-stress."
keywords:
  - evaluation validity
  - construct validity
  - language model evaluation
  - stress-retention
  - quantization
version: "0.6-draft"
